    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fc528f1519139e4fce1261</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Mar 2024 15:30:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>主播</span></strong><span>：楼长</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾</span></strong><span>：阿沈 &nbsp;源一</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>20240316 周六 晴天</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>木强水库徒步三小时，13km后，一起去吃饭，喝早茶</span><strong><span>"莲香楼"</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>不知道怎么的就想到聊聊</span><strong><span>爱情</span></strong><span>~</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>本期摘要：</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">01:16</a> 源一择偶要求</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 相亲六边形</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">06:26</a> &nbsp;你是AI吗</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="519">08:39</a> 果然男的都喜欢年轻的</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 你能接受不要孩子吗</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> 能不能给我相亲相亲啊</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1064">17:44</a> 沟通很重要</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1149">19:09</a> 我不会跟女生私聊</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">21:09</a> 怎么判断对方喜不喜欢你</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>表现1：从我看到这个话题，第一个想到的人是从他开始的</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a> 不会谈恋爱，那你还谈这么多</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2389">39:49</a> 表现2：你把TA的全部都计划到你的未来</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2418">40:18</a> 单身真好</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a> 表现3： 每次看到他都忍不住嘴角上扬</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2661">44:21</a> &nbsp;表现4：以前我发啥，他没回，我会生气，现在我不会生气，会觉得心慌，是怕TA出什么事。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2712">45:12</a> 表现5：</span></blockquote><span></span><h2><strong><span>彩蛋：</span></strong></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>喝早茶的地方，碗碟碰撞声</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>茶楼放的BGM 粤语情歌跟聊天话题莫名契合</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>源一也想相亲</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>楼长笑得好开心</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>阿沈的普通话太普通</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsIJIhEd9vsWWahN5VZs01XUknn1.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljYrh4x993Kusw5vtpj-cPXA7Dxt.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpvunZUe-xMezJjnR2gLBQz6fYMl.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjo1rY8LnSzfzFyg80G8PrfzL4u5.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnY-bdnBrN9TTM09T5sZdH3sl5Th.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr-csOIBHwU0shWM0_0exWH9fa0G.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liMhnrVENxEmYBCidj73Gpb0OLQE.m4a" length="49584538" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:51:02</itunes:duration>
