  <item>
    <title>03-得闲饮茶|广州喝早茶</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65585e19c9e7cfe025cae16d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65585e19c9e7cfe025cae16d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 18 Nov 2023 06:47:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>小黄鸭</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>河豚</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>盛未来@盛未来</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>20231112 周日 晴天</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>昨天还下着雨的广州，今天就放晴了。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>和【河豚】约了一起出去玩， 朋友【盛未来】从杭州飞来广州一日游，在【楼长】的推荐下去，一起去【南国酒家】喝早茶，下午去天河公园散步。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>没有主题的闲聊</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>本期摘要：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> &nbsp;到时我要收版权费</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 录播客的流程</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> &nbsp;脱口秀现场录制互动</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="378">06:18</a> 这样就特别像[基本无害]，吃饭的时候录播客</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="473">07:53</a> 你还想吃吗？这不还有个蛋，你吃蛋</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="506">08:26</a> 你的特长是什么？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="607">10:07</a> 出门在外身份都自己给的</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> 表情包传统刻板印象吗？巨蟹座的男生，居家的好男人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a> 那个拍这么说你小红书拍的肯定是别人拍的</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1588">26:28</a> 考虑一下做做我们的品牌代言人吗？哎，你会滑雪吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1774">29:34</a> 等我下个月再忽悠我老板</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>彩蛋：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>群里好多人都有播客</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>录播客的流程</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>线下脱口秀</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>99% E 的盛总</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>充值了就很开心</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiIeRDKWSDTzduLxLJ0wICsFlHdN.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkMy-0TdWu5RAdF4uAu_A2OUJjsG.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoJZBicpRczqrT9NHotOuK-E5cJ2.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvYt-7E4ysr57CI5SFovIe4gQzN4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgh2banz4e78h7QQos1Sc-qz1eGp.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsC9W7XLergZdZvSbEZtaEagRk0R.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhtSfL8QcT7RwfIUMdWMkj3IVVAo.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu7DI0bvlt0VeLJ84su5lmNWYPLH.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llQHVlIgGOvIZ_IZyrNekr0lMIcG.m4a" length="29397073" type="audio/mp4"/>
